      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dtptraffic/status/1998785905805635813",
      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nIn connection with the ongoing redevelopment work of New Delhi Railway Station (Paharganj Side), traffic movement around Gate No. 1 on Chelmsford Road will remain affected from 10.12.2025 till 31.12.2025.\n\n📍 STRETCH AFFECTED:\nGate No. 1, Chelmsford Road (Paharganj Side)\n\n📍 ADVISORY FOR COMMUTERS:\n* Plan your journey well in advance to avoid delays\n* Use Ajmeri Gate side for station entry and drop-off\n* Avoid unnecessary movement around Gate No. 1 due to restricted access\n\n📍 GENERAL INSTRUCTIONS:\n* Park only in designated areas\n* Avoid roadside parking\n* Report any suspicious object/person immediately to Police\n\n📍 Stay updated through Delhi Traffic Police channels\n\n#DPTrafficAdvisory",
